Sources/LiteRTLM/
    The thin Swift wrapper around the LiteRT-LM C API. Vendored from
    google-ai-edge/litert-lm, release v0.15.0, licensed under the Apache
    License, Version 2.0. Original copyright Google LLC. See each file's header
    and the LICENSE file at the repository root.

    Vendored verbatim except for one local patch, proposed upstream:
    Config.swift declares `Backend` and `EngineConfig` as `Hashable, Sendable`
    (they were `Equatable` and unconstrained). Apple's `LanguageModelExecutor`
    requires `associatedtype Configuration: Hashable & Sendable`, so the
    Foundation Models backend cannot use `EngineConfig` as its configuration
    without this. No behaviour changes; the conformances are synthesized.

    We vendor these files (rather than depending on the upstream SwiftPM
    package) so the package resolves without git-lfs: the upstream repository
    LFS-tracks Android/Linux/Windows prebuilt libraries that are irrelevant to
    Apple platforms but make `swift package resolve` fragile.

CLiteRTLM.xcframework / CLiteRTLM_mac.xcframework
    Prebuilt native runtime binaries downloaded at build time from the official
    LiteRT-LM GitHub releases (v0.15.0). Copyright Google LLC, Apache-2.0.
